  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Length of rod inside the water <math><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0047_d33ae9231e3a.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 158px;\" /><br /><br />Upthrust <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>500</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />Or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math><br /><br />Weight of rod <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math><br /><br />For rotational equilibrium of rod, net torque about O should be zero.<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Or <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />Or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>The hinge force is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi>hinge</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p>"
